Tatoeba, distributed by OPUS
  public/research/v6/lexical-associations.json
  Association parameters derived from the OPUS Tatoeba v2026-07-08 sentence
  collection, contributed by Tatoeba users and distributed by OPUS
  (Jörg Tiedemann), under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France.
  Transformation: normalization, grouping, train-only sparse statistical
  association learning and pruning. Source sentence texts are not included.
  J. Tiedemann, 2012, Parallel Data, Tools and Interfaces in OPUS. LREC 2012.
  Provenance in public/research/v6/source-notices/tatoeba/.

