  texts are German and Italian RTE-3 texts (CC BY 3.0) and Dutch RTE-3 texts
  (CC BY 4.0). Abzianidze, Bjerva, Evang, Haagsma, van Noord, Ludmann,
  Nguyen and Bos (2017), https://aclanthology.org/E17-2039/. Notices in
  public/research/v6/source-notices/pmb/.

