  lib/playground/root-study.json
  public/research/v5/root-study.json
  public/research/v6/root-context-seed-contrasts.json
  The morphological tags of about 18 Quranic words (the qac_* and
  morphological_observation fields) are read from the Quranic Arabic Corpus,
  morphology version 0.4, Copyright (C) 2011 Kais Dukes, University of Leeds,
  licensed under the GNU General Public License with the corpus's terms of use:
  the source is the Quranic Arabic Corpus, https://corpus.quran.com, and each
  tagged word links to its page there. The tags are copied as the corpus gives
  them. The corpus and its full notice are at https://corpus.quran.com/download/.

